  "id": "affective-theory",
  "term": "affective theory",
  "definition": "Affective theory of mind is the part of theory of mind that involves understanding another person’s emotional state, not just what they know or believe. It includes an empathic grasp of others’ feelings and helps in understanding their behavior.",
